#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:25 b6ae35d22fed42c6955e5185e9e7e430
msgid "ArduPilot Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "ArduPilot 连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:27 1ea62550c8e449eab8b8240625072200
msgid ""
"The ESCs should be connected to the autopilot's CAN port.  Below shows the "
"ESCs connected to the autopilot's CAN1 port but CAN2 may also be used.  The "
"ESC furthest from the autopilot's CAN port should have a CAN bus terminator "
"connecting the CAN_L and CAN_H pins.  The VimDrones ESC shown includes a "
"solder pad for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"ESC 应连接到飞控的 CAN 端口。以下示例显示 ESC 连接到飞控的 CAN1 端口，也可使用 CAN2。距飞控 CAN 端口最远的 ESC 应安装"
" CAN 总线终端电阻，连接 CAN_L 和 CAN_H 引脚。图示的 VimDrones ESC 为此提供了焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:32 493848bce5474e96b2f221c028d0ce26
msgid ""
"To enable communication with the AM32 ESCs using DroneCAN, set the following"
" parameters:"
msgstr "要通过 DroneCAN 与 AM32 ESC 通信，请设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:34 cd8561b90c9c4f5db3f654faa47f9c9c
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify that "
"the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器），以指定 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:35 60db4df5d2aa4179b62733100746a3eb
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:37 5cea5206234e45c7a7982509eb031991
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000 so ArduPilot uses an output range that matches the "
"ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 以及 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000，使 ArduPilot 使用与 ESC 输入范围匹配的输出范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:40 263b897c172d43d6907e5d299e5f3272
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to each motor channel (e.g. 33 - 40 for motors 1 - "
"8). This is automatically configured when setting frame class/type. If a "
"motor channel isn't assigned to a servo output, commands won't be sent to "
"the associated ESC."
msgstr ""
"把 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设到各电机通道（如电机 1 - 8 对应 33 - "
"40）。设置机架类别/类型时会自动完成此配置。如果某个电机通道未分配到舵机输出，命令就不会发送到对应的 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:41 7fd06bfae4ca4b619bf373124457438f
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` is a bitmask that determines "
"which servo output channels are transmitted over CAN.  For quadcopters this "
"is normally \"15\""
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` 是一个位掩码，决定哪些舵机输出通道通过 CAN "
"传输。对于四轴飞行器，通常为 `15`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:42 e2d6bcdc401f48a195c9e8cfa677a09f
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` allows for more efficient packing"
" of ESC command messages when ESCs are connected to higher servo outputs "
"(e.g. 5 to 8).  For most vehicles this can be left at zero"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` 在 ESC 连接到较高舵机输出（如 5~8）时，允许更高效地打包 "
"ESC 指令消息。大多数飞行器可保持默认值零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:43 06557fb7f5334bae96b87f5ea05d9d38
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV>` allows specifying which ESCs "
"support spinning in reverse"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV>` 允许指定哪些 ESC 支持反转"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:46 1c1d596d1bea40909964e340475e3367
msgid "ESC Firmware Updates"
msgstr "ESC 固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:48 0c3de80dff3e4c37bed42f7a73032575
msgid ""
"The latest firmwares can be found on the `am32.ca downloads page "
"<https://am32.ca/downloads>`__"
msgstr "最新固件可在 `am32.ca 下载页面 <https://am32.ca/downloads>`__ 获取"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:50 8e72a76a0e9449ce9f550924c373fda0
msgid "To update the ESCs firmware using Mission Planner:"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 更新 ESC 固件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:55 b10db215bc39453cba08f197e0d31708
msgid ""
"Download the firmware from the `am32.ca downloads page "
"<https://am32.ca/downloads>`__"
msgstr "从 `am32.ca 下载页面 <https://am32.ca/downloads>`__ 下载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:79 031fca4f613b446fa884b886f853dc46
#: 59d8019293384ba6b896439ee9c5c300
msgid "Power on the autopilot and ESCs"
msgstr "为飞控和 ESC 上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:57
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:80 2f415397158e4215bd0f28056b6cd37c
#: a4d9aae667684cfd921214a071861700
msgid "Connect to the autopilot using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:58
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:81 0feee655c67f471181f95c40d076643e
#: d390e7f048454ada895d1bf160fcc381
msgid "Open Mission Planner's Setup, Optional Hardware, DroneCAN/UAVCAN page"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的 Setup（设置）> Optional Hardware（可选硬件）> DroneCAN/UAVCAN 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:59
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:82 3799450c58e2408991b5ea01cd65de79
#: 577e135563224cb6816ec62877f1fab8
msgid ""
"Select \"MAVLinkCAN1\" from the drop-down (assuming the ESCs are connected "
"to the autopilot's CAN1 port) and press Connect"
msgstr "从下拉菜单选择 `MAVLinkCAN1`（假设 ESC 连接到飞控的 CAN1 端口）并点击 Connect（连接）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:60 05df9311986945958b995518a41aab00
msgid "The ESCs should appear in the list of connected devices"
msgstr "已连接的 ESC 应出现在设备列表中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:61 88ae30865a9e4a8fac8070ff797d7a69
msgid ""
"For each ESC listed, push the \"Menu\" button on the right and select "
"\"Update\""
msgstr "对列表中的每个 ESC，点击右侧 `Menu`（菜单）按钮并选择 `Update`（更新）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:62 0436276bbf6c4249b61dcc44e3398eed
msgid ""
"When asked, \"Do you want to search the internet for an update?\", push "
"\"No\" and select the firmware downloaded above"
msgstr "当询问 `是否要在网上搜索更新？` 时，点击 `No`（否）并选择上面下载的固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:63 0bd53e96913346ba9283b29e841d360c
msgid ""
"After the firmware is uploaded, check the \"SW Version\" column shows the "
"expected version"
msgstr "固件上传完成后，检查 `SW Version`（软件版本）列是否显示预期版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:66 d276a3cc0b5f43409f31df5bfdbd90c2
msgid "ESC Configuration"
msgstr "ESC 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:68 142dea4adaa749fdae357e8579a3712a
msgid ""
"If the ESCs are already connected to the autopilot (via DroneCAN), they can "
"be configured using Mission Planner's DroneCAN/UAVCAN page or the "
":ref:`DroneCAN GUI Tool <common-uavcan-gui>`.  Alternatively, the `AM32 "
"configurator <https://am32.ca/configurator>`__ can be used by directly "
"connecting to the ESC's PWM connection."
msgstr ""
"如果 ESC 已通过 DroneCAN 连接到飞控，可使用 Mission Planner 的 DroneCAN/UAVCAN 页面或 "
":ref:`DroneCAN GUI 工具 <common-uavcan-gui>` 进行配置。也可通过直接连接 ESC 的 PWM 接口，使用 "
"`AM32 配置器 <https://am32.ca/configurator>`__ 进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:70 bef8100fc5f1425da072c59cb943da80
msgid ""
"In most cases at least some of the following parameters will need to be "
"changed:"
msgstr "大多数情况下，至少需要更改以下部分参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:72 ee491e34205244ac950f1d6d98359f5c
msgid ""
"ESC_INDEX: The motor number - 1.  For multicopters the motor number and "
"position are shown on the :ref:`ESCs and Motors wiki page <copter:connect-"
"escs-and-motors>`"
msgstr ""
"ESC_INDEX：电机编号减 1。多旋翼的电机编号和位置见 :ref:`ESC 与电机维基页面 <copter:connect-escs-and-"
"motors>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:73 7add8e3b22e24d519f89a22aa25e0f06
msgid ""
"DIR_REVERSED: the motor direction.  Use Mission Planner's motor test page to"
" check the direction and change this parameter if necessary"
msgstr "DIR_REVERSED：电机方向。使用 Mission Planner 的电机测试页面检查方向，必要时更改此参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:74 4384070a99aa420eb4efb87f961171b9
msgid "MOTOR_POLES: the number of poles in the motor"
msgstr "MOTOR_POLES：电机极数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:75 b1f446ae53aa4ba0ba2b63440805f921
msgid "MOTOR_KV: the motor's KV rating"
msgstr "MOTOR_KV：电机 KV 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:77 2831f29192994143993a73c8af5f3aaa
msgid "To change the above parameters using Mission Planner:"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 更改上述参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:83 e9ec8ed972514f69b152c79f96b84d27
msgid ""
"For each ESC listed, push the \"Menu\" button on the right and select "
"\"Parameters\""
msgstr "对列表中的每个 ESC，点击右侧 `Menu`（菜单）按钮并选择 `Parameters`（参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:84 85bfe534f3fe479a8f5b88bba82821d0
msgid "Change the parameters as required and press, \"Write Params\""
msgstr "按需修改参数，然后点击 `Write Params`（写入参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:87 a3faf19bbb9348f9ac3fd9f60fd3e302
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与上报"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:89 8d16f235bb8546d49700a062d2608f6a
msgid ""
"ESCs RPM, voltage, current and temperature are recorded in the autopilot's "
"onboard log and reported in real-time to the ground station"
msgstr "ESC 的转速（RPM）、电压、电流和温度将记录于飞控板载日志，并实时上报至地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:96 9740fb1b3b2d44f0ad4f07cd07924c70
msgid "Videos"
